# Retro-Operators

When working backward, learning from history, or debugging from symptom to cause use the **Retro** operator and retro patterns (Retroactive, Retroductive, Retrojection, etc.).

Use the **retro-operators** skill for full patterns, operator sequences (Retro ∘ Ana ∘ Weave, Retro ∘ Non ∘ Weave, etc.), and when to use each. See `.cursor/skills/retro-operators/SKILL.md`.
